  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Philippines: I-LEAD Indigenous Women and Girls &#x2013; Leadership and Empowerment in Ancestral Domains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Activity will build leadership capacity amongst indigenous women and girls in Mindanao, empowering them to participate in the governance of their ancestral lands and improve their livelihood opportunities.</narrative>
